Hi <%= @appointment.contact_name %>,

Your appointment is confirmed:

Clinic: <%= @clinic.name %>
Service: <%= @service.name %>
<% if @appointment.staff.present? -%>
With: <%= @appointment.staff.name.presence || @appointment.staff.email %>
<% end -%>
When: <%= @appointment.starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p") %>
<% if @clinic.address.present? -%>
Address: <%= @clinic.address %>
<% end -%>
<% if @appointment.guest? -%>

Manage or cancel this booking anytime: <%= guest_appointment_url(@appointment.signed_id(purpose: :guest_management, expires_in: 60.days)) %>

Want your appointment history and faster booking next time? Create a free BookQ account: <%= new_user_registration_url(email: @appointment.guest_email) %>
<% else -%>

You can manage this booking anytime from your BookQ account.
<% end -%>
